[[Captain Greywind|Captain Ander Greywind]] (born 1038 <small>[[Mouvelian calendar|AE]]</small>) was a member of the [[Ascalon Army]] until he joined the refugees west into [[Kryta]]. When the [[Ascalon Settlement]] was established, he took leadership of the small village.

